  "releaseNotes": "Preview 6 improves bounded object materialization, file bulk-write coordination, index maintenance, query predicate reuse and allocation behavior. Adds bounded opaque IDB5 envelope metadata, validated detached updates and explicit commit-durability reporting. Reads IDB2-IDB5; preview 5 cannot read IDB5 writes. Keep a pre-upgrade backup for rollback. See the dated performance report for measured gains and regressions.",
